      "bookIndex": 19,
      "hadithIndex": 2531,
      "bookHadithIndex": 20,
      "text": "It was narrated from Maimunah bint Sa`d, the freed slave woman of the Prophet (ﷺ) that :the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) was asked about illegitimate children. He said: “Two sandals in which I wage Jihad are better than freeing an illegitimate child.”",
